<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079105/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079106" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Viro Celeberrimo at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> Doctissimo
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petro Antonio Michelotti</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Joh</abbr><expan>Johannes</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoulli</rs></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Accepi singulas Tuas litteras<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint sind wohl Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151805501">Brief</rs> vom 9. September 1719 und seine Nachfragen zum Paket im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151705501">Brief</rs> vom 15. September, im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151605501">Brief</rs> vom 6. Oktober und im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515151505501">Brief</rs> vom 13. Oktober.</note>: Tandem <add>ips<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></add> quo<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> fasci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cul<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> nactus continentem <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertationem Tuam De
      <lb/>Separatione fluidorum in corpore animali</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Das Manuskript umfasste den ersten Teil der Dissertation. <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-119166895">Nicolaus I Bernoulli</rs> vermutete im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517026105501">Brief</rs> vom 8. November 1719, die Verzögerung sei darauf zurückzuführen, dass das Paket, wie er gehört hatte, von Mailand aus mit den Waren eines Kaufmanns befördert worden sei.</note> juxta cum
      <lb/><rs key="B_991170515151805501" type="letter">litteris Tuis</rs> <choice><abbr>d.</abbr><expan>die</expan></choice> 9<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> Septembris scriptis, et qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dam tenta<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mina <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilii</rs> et <add><rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurini</rs></add><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti legte zwei eigene lateinische Übersetzungen von Abhandlungen James Keills bei. Die beiden Abhandlungen stehen in Keills Ausgabe von 1718 als <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_22EK4JD4">Tentamen III</rs> über die Kraft des Herzens und als <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_W3P7C2J2">Tentamen V</rs> über die Muskelbewegung. Die Sätze von James Jurin stammen wohl aus dessen Abhandlung <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M6Z9EVAL">De motu aquarum fluentium</rs>.</note> de quib<choice><orig><g ref="#us">[us]</g></orig><reg>us</reg></choice> judicium meum petis.
      <lb/>Fasciculus iste post longam in itinere moram <add>nudius</add>
      <lb/>quart<choice><orig><g ref="#us">[us]</g></orig><reg>us</reg></choice> demum h<choice><orig><g ref="#uhat">û</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>c pervenit. Desideras ut Dissertatio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>n<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> manuscriptam at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> satis diffusam, attente
      <lb/>legam, ut corrigam, ut moneam necessa<add>ria</add>, ut monita
      <lb/>co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>unicem, ut adjecta tentamina sub examen revoc<del>a</del><add>e</add>m,
      <lb/>ut notata mea in chartam conjiciam, <choice><orig><g ref="#etlig">&amp;</g></orig><reg>et</reg></choice>c. <del>tempores</del> <add>Imponi<del>t</del><add>s</add></add>
      <lb/>mihi arduam san<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> Provinciam, hoc pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sertim tempore
      <lb/>quod ob varias <add>r</add>ationes minime est co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>od<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>: occupa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tum nam<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> me tenent plurima negotia, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> urgent qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice>
      <lb/>prius sunt expedienda, quam aliis me implic<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>, accedunt
      <lb/>dies h<choice><orig><g ref="#ydots">ÿ</g></orig><reg>y</reg></choice>emales qui brevem usuram ad studia <add>di<unclear>ur</unclear>na</add>
      <lb/>suppeditant, noctu<add>r</add>nis <del>etuam</del> <add>enim</add> <add>lucubrationibus</add>
<pb facs="1079107" n="2"/>
      <lb/>ob <add>oculorum</add> meorum imbecillitatem abstinere
      <lb/>cogor. Rogo <add>ita<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice></add> ut patienter feras, si quod <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me petis per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ficiendum, in tempus co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>odius distulero, at<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> in l<unclear>on</unclear>gum
      <lb/>prot<add>raxero</add>; promitto me hoc negotium ad man<unclear><choice><orig><g ref="#us">[us]</g></orig><reg>us</reg></choice></unclear> sumturum
      <lb/>quam prim<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m licu<add>erit</add>, si quid inte<add>rim</add> ad me <add>scribendum</add> habes,
      <lb/>rogo ut litteras Tuas (ut ego facere soleo) simpliciter
      <lb/>complices nullo adhibito <add>involucro</add>, hoc enim statim auge<unclear>t</unclear>
      <lb/>pret<add>ium</add> portorii, cura etiam, ut molem habeant <add>parvam</add> <choice><orig><g ref="#etlig">&amp;</g></orig><reg>et</reg></choice>
      <lb/>tenuem resecando omnem chartam albam et superfl<add>uam</add>,
      <lb/>cogar hoc iter<add>ato </add>mon<choice><orig><g ref="#eacut">é</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>re, quia null<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> epistol<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> plur<add>is</add>
      <lb/>mihi constant, quam qu<add>as</add> ex <rs key="place_KON-italie" type="place">Italia</rs> accipio et quas illuc
      <lb/>mitto: nam pro qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>libet accipiend<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> et ad eam responsione
      <lb/>danda, etsi simplicissimum habeant volumen erogan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dus mihi est dimidius flore<add>n</add>us germanicus, et plus ad<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>huc <add>si paul<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice></add> spiss<add>ius</add> sit volumen. Ex inspectione obiter fact<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_WCRRQGZT" type="biblio">tenta<add>minis</add></rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keiliani</rs> <add>de motu</add> musculorum video quod pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cipu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>est, esse exscriptum ex <rs key="biblio_JAFFCHKU" type="biblio">dissertatione</rs> mea, et figuras
      <lb/>quo<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> meas <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keili<add>um</add></rs> mutuatum ess<add>e</add>, paucis tantum
      <lb/>mutatis, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> nihil ad rem faciunt; <add>miror</add> ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> impu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dentiam Hominis tam <add>crassum</add> plagium co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>ittentis
      <lb/>ut etiam nomen meum dissimularit; si quis ex nos<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tratibus hujus modi plagium contra <choice><orig>anglos</orig><reg>Anglos</reg></choice> patrasset<unclear>,</unclear>
      <lb/>quam non terribili clamore <add>in</add> plagi<choice><orig><g ref="#aacut">á</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>rium debacchare<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tur; si quidem exteris nihil reli<add>n</add>quere velint, et ne
<pb facs="1079108" n="3"/>
      <lb/>ea quidem q<unclear>u<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></unclear> in <choice><orig>angli<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></orig><reg>Angli<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice></reg></choice> non fuerunt nota, per me licet, ut
      <lb/>dissertationes meas <add>recudi</add> cures, modo correcta prode<add>ant</add> ubi
      <lb/>otium mihi fuerit examina<add>bo</add> <rs key="biblio_WCRRQGZT" type="biblio">tentamen</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilianum</rs> et
      <lb/>mittam Tibi annotationes meas. Intellexi quo<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> ex
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato</rs> meo, se valedixisse su<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> stationi et propediem
      <lb/>Patriam repetiturum: nuncius iste de repentin<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> et ino<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pinata illa mutatione quadrie<choice><orig><g ref="#nn">n̄</g></orig><reg>nn</reg></choice>io <add>nondum</add> completo (quod in
      <lb/>ipsius vocatione erat statut<add>um</add>) <add>mirifice</add> me perculit;
      <lb/>Vellem scire qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>na<add>m</add> hujus sit vera causa, et an sit
      <lb/>culpa <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> parte <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnati</rs> mei, an <add>ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice></add> <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> parte vestr<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>tium
      <lb/>qui forsan eum expulerunt, quod esset inhumanissim<unclear><choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>.</unclear>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filius</rs> meus nunc mo<add>r</add>a<choice><orig><g ref="#tur">&#xf199;</g></orig><reg>tur</reg></choice> <rs key="place_GEO-2925177" type="place">Friburgi</rs> apud Comitem de <rs key="pers_DE-588-1012270238" type="person">Harsc<add>h</add></rs>
      <lb/>Gubernatorem illius loci, ut sit <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-136051642 pers_DE-588-1053356978">Filiorum</rs> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1012270238" type="person">illius</rs>
      <lb/>in studiis Director.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir clarissim<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> et <add>mi</add><pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>hi porr<choice><orig><g ref="#ograv">ò</g></orig><reg>o</reg></choice> fave.</salute>
<dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <choice><abbr><choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>.</abbr><expan><choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>nte</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>d.</abbr><expan>diem</expan></choice> XVIII<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice>
      <lb/>Octobris 1719.</dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p><lb/>P. S. Mi<add>si</add> <add>an</add>te aliquot <add>menses</add> <add>ad</add> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatum</rs> meum,
